    {
      "source": "Entity callback method invoked before a domain object is saved. Can return either the same or a modified instance\nof the domain object and can modify <a href=\"../mapping/OutboundRow.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.r2dbc.mapping\"><code>OutboundRow</code></a> contents. This method is called after converting the\n<code>entity</code> to a <a href=\"../mapping/OutboundRow.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.r2dbc.mapping\"><code>OutboundRow</code></a> so effectively the row is used as outcome of invoking this callback.\nChanges to the domain object are not taken into account for saving, only changes to the row. Only transient fields\nof the entity should be changed in this callback. To change persistent the entity before being converted, use the\n<a href=\"../mapping/event/BeforeConvertCallback.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.r2dbc.mapping.event\"><code>BeforeConvertCallback</code></a>.",
      "translation": "在保存领域对象之前调用实体回调方法。该方法可以返回相同的或修改后的领域对象实例，并可以修改 <a href=\"../mapping/OutboundRow.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.r2dbc.mapping\"><code>OutboundRow</code></a> 的内容。此方法在将<code>entity</code>转换为<a href=\"../mapping/OutboundRow.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.r2dbc.mapping\"><code>OutboundRow</code></a>之后被调用，因此实际上该行被视为调用此回调的结果。领域对象的更改不会用于保存，只有行的更改才会被考虑。在此回调中应仅更改实体的瞬态字段。若要在使用转换之前更改持久化的实体，请使用<a href=\"../mapping/event/BeforeConvertCallback.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.r2dbc.mapping.event\"><code>BeforeConvertCallback</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">Description copied from interface: <code><a href=\"../mapping/event/BeforeSaveCallback.html#onBeforeSave(T,org.springframework.data.r2dbc.mapping.OutboundRow,org.springframework.data.relational.core.sql.SqlIdentifier)\">BeforeSaveCallback</a></code></span>",
      "translation": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">描述从接口复制：<code><a href=\"../mapping/event/BeforeSaveCallback.html#onBeforeSave(T,org.springframework.data.r2dbc.mapping.OutboundRow,org.springframework.data.relational.core.sql.SqlIdentifier)\">BeforeSaveCallback</a></code></span>",
      "count": 1
